 (text "PRE-PMIC 3V3_SYS: 5V_SYS to fixed 3.3V / 3A" (at 70 65 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000124"))
(text "U6 TPS62132RGTT: 3V to 17V input, fixed 3.3V output, 3A max. EN tied to 5V_SYS." (at 70 78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000125"))
(text "Fixed-output configuration: FB=AGND, DEF=GND (nominal 3.3V), FSW=GND (2.5MHz), SS/TR=3.3nF to GND. PG unused." (at 70 88 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000126"))
(text "Keep VCC3V3_SYS separate from RK809 SWOUT1 net VCC_3V3. VCC3V3_SYS supplies RK809 VCC1-VCC9 and VCC_RTC." (at 70 98 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000127"))
(text "Layout: place CIN at PVIN/AVIN; keep SW-U6-L8-COUT loop compact; solder EP17 to GND plane with thermal vias. Validate 3A thermal margin on final stackup." (at 70 108 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000128"))
